1 polymer man 'Cytoplasmic FMR1-interacting protein 1'           145363.750 1 ? ? ? 
;This construct contains two additional uncleaved residues "GA" in the N terminus from the construct design and purification procedure. Densities for these residues are not observed in the map and were not included in the sample sequence to avoid numbering shifts.
;
2 polymer man 'Nck-associated protein 1'                         128940.727 1 ? ? ? 
;This construct contains two additional uncleaved residues "GA" in the N terminus from the construct design and purification procedure. Densities for these residues are not observed in the map and were not included in the sample sequence to avoid numbering shifts.
;
3 polymer man 'Wiskott-Aldrich syndrome protein family member 1' 37009.406  1 ? ? ? 
;Residues 231-248 are inserted as a flexible linker sequence. This construct contains two additional uncleaved residues "GA" in the N terminus from the construct design and purification procedure. Densities for these residues are not observed in the map and were not included in the sample sequence to avoid numbering shifts.
;
4 polymer man 'Protein BRICK1'                                   8756.915   1 ? ? ? 
;This construct contains uncleaved residues "GHMGAA" in the N terminus from the construct design and purification procedure. Densities for the residues are not observed in the map and were not included in the sample sequence to avoid numbering shifts.
;
5 polymer man 'Abl interactor 2'                                 18041.482  1 ? ? ? 
;The sequence only contains residues 1-158. Also, there are two additional uncleaved residues "GH" in the N terminus from the construct design and purification procedure. Densities for these residues are not observed in the map and were not included in the sample sequence to avoid numbering shifts.
;
